      "content": "wait, increase my salt intake?? my midwife told me to stay away from too much salt because of the swelling. and i thought ibuprofen wasn't supposed to be taken in the third trimester? i'm getting a little confused now. if i just take the ibuprofen and keep the salt high like you said, will the lights and the puffiness go away on their own by next week?",
